{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id498215333"}, "name":{"label":"TheCoolKidsClub"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-06-19T15:26:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.3.2"}, "id":{"label":"10051500017"}, "title":{"label":"Snowy blizzard from the icy rizzard of Oz"}, "content":{"label":"I must say, this app exceeded all expectations. I woke up extra early this morning (11:00AM) to text my Tinder fling after she left work (She lives in Ireland). Pulling out RizzGPT then LITERALLY transformed our relationship… \n\nI ask “Hey baby, is water wet, or is that just you?” to which she replies, \n\n“oOooOAHHughGh, I just rizzed all over myself! 😵‍💫When will I SEE YOU AGAIN?”\n\n“No surprise, guess I’m just Rizz Khalifa”, I retort, sensing her ovulation from 2400 miles away.\n\nAnother win from RizzGPT.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1663430725&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
